        "original_id": "fd9bb6dd-ab53-576d-8462-e65ad51fa2be",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Steve Perry, Dennis Lyxzén, Jonathan Cain\n- Organizations: Journey, Refused, INVSN\n- Products: After the Fall, Frontiers\n\nFacts:\n- Steve Perry was the lead singer of Journey during the band's most commercially successful periods from 1977 to 1987 and again from 1995 to 1998.\n- Frontiers was released in 1983.\n- Jonathan Cain and Steve Perry wrote the song \"After the Fall.\"\n- \"After the Fall\" was the third single released from the 1983 album Frontiers.\n- Dennis Lyxzén was born on June 19, 1972, in Umeå, Sweden.\n- Dennis Lyxzén is a musician best known as the lead vocalist for the Swedish hardcore punk band Refused.\n- Dennis Lyxzén is currently the vocalist in INVSN.",
